# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [Unreleased]

## [v1.0.1] - 2026-02-22

### Added

 - Server: Fix parent cache memory retention in methodsv2
 - Server: Added SQLite persistent job store, with configuration options
 - Server: Startup recovery — "running" jobs are failed and "queued" jobs are re-enqueued on restart
 - Server: Added versioned schema migration runner
 - Server: `GONEMASTER_*` environment variable support for all configuration fields (override by CLI flags)
 - Server: `--config` JSON file support for persistent configuration
 - Docs: Canonical testcase specifications for all 73 implemented testcases under `docs/specifications/`
 - Docs: Per-module tag catalogs in `docs/specifications/tags/` generated from live code metadata
 - Tools: Spec validation tooling (`make spec-validate`, `make spec-check-tags`) for CI drift detection
 - Recursor: Add bailiwick filtering for trusted glue addresses
 - Recursor: Bound recurse cache growth to reduce long-run memory pressure
 - Recursor: Scope recurse cache by resolver context (root vs custom NS set)
 - Recursor: Add regression tests for cache isolation/limits and glue filtering

### Changed

 - Harmonized `--version` across programs
 - Recursor: Do not cache empty recurse responses

## [v1.0.0] - 2026-02-19

### Added

Initial release 1.0.0.

- Added --stop-level to CLI
- Added --sourceaddr and --sourceaddr6 options to CLI
- Added CLI cache options to CLI
- Added tag counters to CLI
- Added undelegated testing to CLI and Web UI
- Added the last needed DEBUG outputs from the engine

### Changed

 - Added the option to use the CLI without "--domain" if it is the last argument

## [0.9.19] - 2026-02-18

### Added

- Server throughput/contestion work
- Engine performance optimization
- Zonemaster parity/correctness improvements
- New performance toolkit for repeatable benchmarking
- Documentation and GoDoc improvements

### Changed

- Minor UI improvements and changes

## [0.9.18] - 2026-02-10

### Added

- Major performance improvements

## [0.9.17] - 2026-02-07

### Added

 - Added separate IPv4 and IPv6 metrics
 - Batch job dropdown added
 - New notification method for UI

### Changed

 - Progress bars are the same length in Recent jobs

## [0.9.16] - 2026-02-07

### Added

 - Added server metrics to UI and server API
 - Added GoDocs

### Changed

 - Fixed ".arpa" delegation bug.
